Feature: Result columns fit their rendered header and cell text

  Background:
    Given the extension is in a clean state
    When I move the Dev Host to 0, 0
    And I resize the Dev Host to 900x800
    And I execute command "workbench.action.closeSidebar"
    And I execute command "workbench.action.closeAuxiliaryBar"
    And I execute command "workbench.action.closePanel"

  Scenario: Null-only and long-text columns stay tight before and after sorting
    When I delete file "tests/vscode-extension-tester/runs/default/result-column-widths/column-widths.kqlx"
    Given a file "tests/vscode-extension-tester/runs/default/result-column-widths/column-widths.kqlx" exists with content:
      """
